<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AMATECHIA BALLA</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#0f0f0f;color:white;font-family:Arial;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100vh}
.header{background:#1a1a1a;padding:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #333}
.logo{width:45px;height:45px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f9d949,#3ec70b,#ff0000);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:bold;color:black}
.header-text h1{font-size:16px}
.header-text p{font-size:11px;color:#00ff88}
.date-creation{font-size:10px;color:#aaa;margin-top:2px}
.chat{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:15px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.msg{background:#222;padding:12px;border-radius:15px;max-width:85%;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}
.input-area{background:#1a1a1a;padding:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #333}
.input-area input{flex:1;background:#2a2a2a;border:1px solid #444;color:white;padding:12px;border-radius:25px;outline:none}
.input-area button{background:#00c853;color:white;border:none;padding:0 18px;border-radius:25px;font-weight:bold}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
<div class="logo">AB</div>
<div class="header-text">
<h1>AMATECHIA BALLA</h1>
<p>Par Balla Moussa Diawara • Conakry 🇬🇳 • 613754349</p>
<div class="date-creation">Créée le 19 Oct 2026 - Km36 🇬🇳</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="chat" id="chat">
<div class="msg">Salut ! Je suis AMATECH IA BALLA 🇬🇳<br><br>Créée par <b>Balla Moussa Diawara</b>, première IA Guinéenne à Conakry.<br><br>Comment je peux t'aider ?</div>
</div>

<div class="input-area">
<input type="text" id="userInput" placeholder="Question pour Balla Moussa...">
<button onclick="send()">Envoyer</button>
</div>

<script>
function send(){
let input=document.getElementById('userInput');
let txt=input.value.trim();
if(!txt)return;
let chat=document.getElementById('chat');
chat.innerHTML+=`<div class="msg" style="align-self:flex-end;background:#00c853">${txt}</div>`;
input.value='';
setTimeout(()=>{
chat.innerHTML+=`<div class="msg">Merci pour ta question : "${txt}" ! Je suis AMATECHIA BALLA, créée par Balla Moussa Diawara le 19 Oct 2026. Comment je peux t'aider d'autre ? 🇬🇳</div>`;
chat.scrollTop=chat.scrollHeight;
},500);
chat.scrollTop=chat.scrollHeight;
}
document.getElementById('userInput').addEventListener('keypress',function(e){if(e.key==='Enter')send();});
</script>
</body>
</html>
